 "_doc": [
  "Live probe of the Muse Code subscription door, 2026-10-12, lambda, account on the Muse Code Power Usage plan.",
  "A standalone stdlib script (not lm15) sending the requests lm15's meta device flow sends, then models and one tiny call per model.",
  "Secrets, personal data and payment details are replaced by <redacted>; the key shape is LLM|… (48 characters).",
  "Not in this file: a second mint 2 minutes later answered HTTP 200 with the same api_key; both 'keys' (one key) listed 12 models;",
  "chat/completions and /v1/messages answered HTTP 200 for muse-wonder-full-1.0 on the same key; a bogus key answered 401 invalid_api_key.",
  "An earlier device code left unapproved answered 400 {error: expired_token, error_description: 'device_code expired.'} at its expiry."
 ]
}
